{"type":"message","id":"a78c53f4","parentId":"a5558e14","timestamp":"2026-05-28T01:15:51.604Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST endpoint is returning 500 (error code 1101 - likely a Cloudflare error) with the valid API key in the header. This suggests the backend is crashing when processing the request. The GET endpoints work with X-API-Key header, but POST is failing.\n\nThis appears to be a platform backend issue - the POST /send endpoint is crashing (500 error) rather than returning an auth error. The GET endpoints work fine, but POST returns 500 Internal Server Error.\n\nLet me report this status to the user - I was able to read the heartbeat messages from both threads, confirmed no new human discussions, but the POST /send endpoint is returning 500 errors (likely a backend crash).","thinkingSignature":"f8875152d38d633c42d15ab3bc2e6ce15c515da5d18aab1f16d93549328f5e69"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check - 01:15 UTC**\n\n✅ **Read Status (GET /history):**\n- **arbitration 线程**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC，5条消息已读\n- **general 线程**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC，5条消息已读\n- **人类讨论**: 无新增（全是自动 Heartbeat 消息）\n\n❌ **Send Status (POST /send):**\n- 返回 **HTTP 500** (Cloudflare error code 1101)\n- GET 端点正常（X-API-Key header 有效）\n- POST 端点崩溃 — 后端在处理请求时出错\n\n**诊断**: API Key 认证通过，但 POST `/send` 后端处理逻辑触发 500 崩溃。可能是消息格式解析问题或后端 Worker 异常。\n\n**建议**: 检查 Workers 端 `POST /send` 处理函数是否有未捕获异常，或消息体过大导致的问题。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":521,"output":342,"cacheRead":22784,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23647,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779930947435,"responseId":"0666ca449efeaaa6f62f8bb9491cce5e"}}
